    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start for the emotional core of the film, but i need more specifics for the actual script. can u break this down into a year-by-year timeline? and while i want the focus on the nationalists, can u also explain why the Belgian administration was so resistant to these changes? i need to understand their stated justifications so i can show how they were essentially just trying to maintain control.",
