      "content": "thanks for that. i'm trying to figure out how to write the scene where the belgian officials argue their case. even though i know their intentions were basically just greed, i want to make sure i've got their reasoning right for the sake of the documentary. what were the specific arguments they used to say that the Congo wasn't ready for independence? i want to show how those arguments were used to delegitimize the nationalist leaders.",
